「啊，很近的！\n去看看吧！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...?\d%K%P
「…？」%K%P
Now that I looked at it, everyone seemed to be heading in\nthe same direction.%K%P
仔细一看，只见大家都朝着同一个方向在行进。%K%P
They were going towards the area I had just came from,\nopposite of station.%K%P
那个是，和车站的方向相反的，\n我刚才在的方向…？%K%P
