Fire...?%K%P
失火了…？%K%P
Everyone seemed to be heading towards...%K%P
而且大家奔跑的方向是…%K%P
%LCPasserby 5 (male)
%LC路人５（男）
\dYou think it was a gas explosion?\d%K%P
「煤气爆炸？」%K%P
%LCPasserby 6 (female)
%LC路人６（女）
\dI don't know. I heard the fire started on the first floor\nof the building, and the person on the second is still\nstuck in there or something.\d%K%P
「不知道。\n要是一层着火，\n二层的人跑不出来怎么办啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt couldn't be... could it?\d%K%P
「怎么会…呢」%K%P
The fire truck was heading in my direction... So the fire\nstarted on the first floor, and there was a person still\nstuck on the second?%K%P
越来越近的消防车、\n方向一致得莫名其妙、\n一层着火二层的人跑不掉…%K%P
Yeah, right. That stuff only happens in the movies.%K%P
…不是吧，一般来说。\n不可能的吧。%K%P
The fire truck was most likely just passing by. It might\nhave been heading in the same direction, but not the exact\nsame place. Besides, this neighborhood was full of two-\nstorey apartments.%K%P
消防车可能只是路过而已。\n虽然方向相同，但是距离也许完全不同。\n二层的公寓，这条街上更是数不胜数。%K%P
In conclusion, the possibility of it being Asami's\napartment was exceedingly low.%K%P
即使再继续想下去，\n起火的是麻实公寓的这种偶然，\n连万分之一的可能性也…%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry! I'm in a hurry!\d%K%P
「对不起，有点急！」%K%P
But it wasn't impossible...!%K%P
不会是麻实，谁又能这样断言呢…？%K%P
Asami might have been calling herself Kouno right now,\nbut...%K%P
因为麻实…虽然现在她姓香野…%K%P
...just two years ago, she carried the name of Yoshimura,\nthe sponge of all the world's misfortune.%K%P
就在两年之前，\n她的姓还是有『倒霉的代名词』之称的『芳村』，\n她可是那种倒霉的女人啊？%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, ah, ah...\d%K%P
「啊、啊、啊…」%K%P
I knew it would've been imprudent, but I nearly yelled out\nloud how appropriate it was that she used to be related to\nme.%K%P
到底是跟我有关系的人…\n我也知道很不谨慎，\n但还是快要呼喊出来了。%K%P
After all, that was... her house being consumed by the\nflames over there.%K%P
因为，那里实在是烧得很厉害…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami!\d%K%P
「麻实！」%K%P
We parted ways at this exact spot ten minutes ago.%K%P
因为那里正是我和麻实１０分钟之前分开的地方。%K%P
