\dI haven't got a second to waste!\d%K%P
「一分一秒都要争取！」%K%P
The fire hadn't yet spread to the stairs, so I somehow\nmanaged to get up to the second floor.%K%P
火还没有烧到房子外面来，\n还有办法从二楼跑下来。%K%P
But...%K%P
但是…%K%P
