但是二层走廊上的烟雾，\n那也是能杀人的东西。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami! Asami!\d%K%P
「麻实，麻实！」%K%P
The door was so hot I burned my knuckles by merely\nknocking on it.%K%P
热度传到了门上，\n这让我不禁使劲敲门。%K%P
That completely ruled out opening it in the normal way...%K%P
这么烫的门…\n根本不可能用手打开。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDamn it... Fuck!\d%K%P
「可恶，可恶！」%K%P
I had no more time to waste. If my bare hands couldn't\ntake it, then perhaps my feet, protected by shoes,\ncould...%K%P
已经顾不上那么多了。\n既然没法用手打开，那就踹开…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCome on... Please...!\nOpen up!!\d%K%P
「拜托，拜托了！\n给我开开啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHah!\d%K%P
「额！」%K%P
My fifth kick finally blew the door of Room #203 off its\nhinges.%K%P
大概踢了五下，\n２０３号房间的门终于被我踹开了…%K%P
Fresh air invaded the room, bolstering the flames even\nfurther.%K%P
因为有氧气的补充，火焰燃烧得更旺了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami!\d%K%P
「麻实！」%K%P
But this was my chance.%K%P
但这对我而言是千载难逢的机会。%K%P
I wrapped my jacket around my head and jumped into Asami's\nroom, answering her invitation from ten minutes ago.%K%P
我把上衣盖在头上，\n作为１０分钟之前邀请的回应，\n终于来到了麻实的房间…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAre you in here?! Answer me, Asami!\d%K%P
「回话啊！\n麻实！」%K%P
The interior of the room was quite a bit different from\nwhat I had imagined.%K%P
冲进房间之后，\n发现房间里和我想象的并不一样。%K%P
It was a mess, just like Asami had claimed. But rather\nthan being untidy, it was more like a warzone, with pieces\nof what used to be furniture littering the entire space.%K%P
正如麻实所说，家里『乱糟糟』的…不对，\n这只是因为爆炸着火弄坏的家具，\n分散零落在房间里，已经不可能再修复了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAsami! Asami?!\d%K%P
「麻实！\n麻实！？」%K%P
The oak cupboard.\nThe white round table.\nThe closet with one handle missing.%K%P
橡木的碗柜。\n白色的圆桌。\n掉了一边把手的壁橱。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「…诶？」%K%P
Familiar covers sizzling on the shelf.\nThat bulky 27-inch CRT TV.\nThe cups we picked together... lying on the floor...%K%P
我所熟知的书脊在书柜里整整齐齐地排列着。\n胡乱摆放着的２７寸电视机。\n从碗柜里掉落下来的是餐具，都是我们两人所挑选的…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat... is this...?\d%K%P
「这些是什么啊…」%K%P
I felt a deep sense of incongruity at this place.%K%P
在麻实的房间里，我感到了一股极大的不协调感。%K%P
I was expecting it to be a completely unfamiliar place,\nbut... it was the exact opposite.%K%P
因为与我完全无关的景象在我眼前展开。\n…不对，完全相反。%K%P
