This was definitely not the time to get lost in my own\npointless thoughts.%K%P
现在可不是回顾过去的时候。%K%P
There was something much more important I needed to be\ndoing right now.%K%P
跟『那样的大事』相比，\n现在有更重要的事。%K%P
